-\noindent--- Justice John Paul Stevens, Dissenting, 521 U.S. at 944 (\href{https://www.law.cornell.edu/supct/html/95-1478.ZD.html}{Cornell LII}; \href{https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/118148/printz-v-united-states/}{CourtListener}).
