+\noindent --- Justice George Sutherland, Dissenting Opinion, 300 U.S. at 404 (\href{https://caselaw.findlaw.com/court/us-supreme-court/300/379.html}{FindLaw}; \href{https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/102784/west-coast-hotel-co-v-parrish/}{CourtListener}).
 
 \begin{quote}
 ``Women today stand upon a legal and political equality with men. There is no longer any reason why they should be put in different classes in respect of their legal right to make contracts; nor should they be denied, in effect, the right to compete with men for work paying lower wages which men may be willing to accept.''
 \end{quote}
---- Justice George Sutherland, Dissenting Opinion, 300 U.S. at 411--412 (\href{https://constitutioncenter.org/the-constitution/supreme-court-case-library/west-coast-hotel-co-v-parrish}{National Constitution Center}; \href{https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/102784/west-coast-hotel-co-v-parrish/}{CourtListener}).
