---- Chief Justice Burger, 462 U.S. at 952.
+``In purporting to exercise power defined in Art. I, \S~8, cl. 4, to `establish an uniform Rule of Naturalization,' the House took action that had the purpose and effect of altering the legal rights, duties, and relations of persons, including the Attorney General, Executive Branch officials and Chadha, all outside the Legislative Branch.''
 \end{quote}
+\noindent --- Chief Justice Burger, 462 U.S. at 952.
 
