-  \item \textbf{Argued / Decided:} Argued March 2, 1920; decided April 19, 1920
-  \item \textbf{Vote:} 7--2
-  \item \textbf{Author:} Justice Oliver Wendell Holmes Jr.\ (joined by Chief Justice Edward Douglass White, and Justices Joseph McKenna, William R.\ Day, James Clark McReynolds, Louis D.\ Brandeis, and John H.\ Clarke)
-  \item \textbf{Concurrences / Dissents:} No concurrences. Justices Willis Van Devanter and Mahlon Pitney dissented without opinion.
