-\section{Case Metadata}
-
-\begin{itemize}
-  \item \textbf{Case Name:} \href{https://supreme.justia.com/cases/federal/us/395/444/}{\emph{Brandenburg v.\ Ohio}}, 395 U.S.\ 444 (1969) (No.\ 492).
-  \item \textbf{Court \& Dates:} Supreme Court of the United States; argued February 27, 1969; decided June 9, 1969 (\href{https://www.oyez.org/cases/1968/492}{Oyez}).
-  \item \textbf{Vote \& Alignment:} 8--0 unanimous \emph{per curiam} decision reversing the Supreme Court of Ohio (Warren, C.J., and Black, Douglas, Harlan, Brennan, Stewart, White, and Marshall, JJ.; one seat vacant following Justice Fortas's resignation; \href{https://constitutioncenter.org/the-constitution/supreme-court-case-library/brandenburg-v-ohio}{National Constitution Center}).
