-\section{Case Metadata}
-
-\begin{itemize}
-  \item \textbf{Case Name:} \textit{Bivens v. Six Unknown Named Agents of Federal Bureau of Narcotics}, 403 U.S. 388 (1971) (91 S. Ct. 1999; 29 L. Ed. 2d 619).
-  \item \textbf{Briefing Book Placement:} Chapter 1: Judicial Review and the Federal Courts (Implied Constitutional Causes of Action and Judicial Remedies).
