-  \item \textbf{Standing--Mootness Asymmetry:} \textit{Laidlaw} decisively refutes the simplistic exam shorthand that ``mootness is just standing set in a time frame.'' Always remember that burden allocation shifts from plaintiff (standing) to defendant (mootness), and voluntary cessation saves a live suit that would have failed standing if filed after compliance.
-\end{itemize}
