-  \item \textbf{Opinion Authorship:} Per Curiam (joined in full by Roberts, C.J., and Thomas, Alito, Gorsuch, and Kavanaugh, JJ.); Barrett, J., concurring in part (joining Parts I and II--B) and concurring in the judgment; Sotomayor, Kagan, and Jackson, JJ., jointly concurring in the judgment
