+\noindent --- Justice Brennan, \href{https://supreme.justia.com/cases/federal/us/437/518/}{\textit{Hicklin v. Orbeck}, 437 U.S.\ 518, 534 (1978)} (\href{https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/109911/hicklin-v-orbeck/}{CourtListener}).
 
