+\noindent --- Justice Breyer, Dissenting (joined by Justices Ginsburg and Sotomayor), 561 U.S. at 915 (\href{https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/149702/mcdonald-v-city-of-chicago/}{CourtListener}; \href{https://www.khanacademy.org/humanities/constitution-101/x7a03a96a83aa80ff:the-bill-of-rights/x7a03a96a83aa80ff:second-amendment-modern-cases-and-debates/a/primary-source-mcdonald-v-city-of-chicago-2012}{Khan Academy}).
